   "html": "<p>2-2. The information in this section describes the installation and operation of the Model 732A. It is recommended that the contents of this section be read and understood before any attempt is made to operate the instrument. Should any difficulties arise during operation, contact your nearest John Fluke Sales Representative, or the factory. Our mailing address is: John Fluke Mfg. Co., Inc.;P.O. Box C9090;Everett, WA 98206 (206) 347-6100<\/p>",
