   "group": "Section 2 · Operation",
   "level": 3,
   "boards": [],
   "html": "<p>2-4. The 732A is packaged and shipped in a foam-packed container. Upon receipt of the instrument, a thorough physical and electrical inspection should be made to reveal any possible shipping damage. Special instructions for inspection and claims are included on the shipping carton.<\/p>\n<p>2-5. If reshipment of the instrument is necessary, the original container or equivalent should be used.<\/p>\n<p>2-6. If the instrument is to be shipped with battery power on, use the Transit Case accessory described in Section 6. Alternatively, 24V to 40V dc or 24V to 30V ac may be applied, via the rear panel connectors, to supply power during shipment.<\/p>",
   "text": "2-4. The 732A is packaged and shipped in a foam-packed container. Upon receipt of the instrument, a thorough physical and electrical inspection should be made to reveal any possible shipping damage. Special instructions for inspection and claims are included on the shipping carton. 2-5. If reshipment of the instrument is necessary, the original container or equivalent should be used. 2-6. If the instrument is to be shipped with battery power on, use the Transit Case accessory described in Section 6. Alternatively, 24V to 40V dc or 24V to 30V ac may be applied, via the rear panel connectors, to supply power during shipment.",
