   "file": "02-operation.md",
   "group": "Section 2 · Operation",
   "level": 3,
   "boards": [],
   "html": "<p>2-10. The Front and Rear panels are shown in Figures 2-1 and 2-2. The various controls and connections are listed and explained in Tables 2-1 and 2-2.<\/p>",
