   "file": "02-operation.md",
   "group": "Section 2 · Operation",
   "level": 3,
   "boards": [],
   "html": "<p>2-26. If the IN CAL indicator does not illuminate (ac power lost, battery dead or turned off), the output of the 732A may not meet the specifications listed in Section 1. The RESET terminal, located behind the front panel, is used to restore the IN CAL indicator to the ON condition.<\/p>",
   "text": "2-26. If the IN CAL indicator does not illuminate (ac power lost, battery dead or turned off), the output of the 732A may not meet the specifications listed in Section 1. The RESET terminal, located behind the front panel, is used to restore the IN CAL indicator to the ON condition.",
   "mentions": []
