   "file": "02-operation.md",
   "group": "Section 2 · Operation",
   "level": 3,
   "boards": [],
   "html": "<p>2-37. The inherent accuracy and stability of the 732A may be easily degraded if the effects of thermal emf, lead resistance and other factors are not considered and minimized.<\/p>",
   "text": "2-37. The inherent accuracy and stability of the 732A may be easily degraded if the effects of thermal emf, lead resistance and other factors are not considered and minimized.",
