   "boards": [],
   "html": "<p>4-10. Use the following procedures to disassemble the 732A for adjustment or repair. Disconnect ac power connections before disassembling the 732A.<\/p>",
   "text": "4-10. Use the following procedures to disassemble the 732A for adjustment or repair. Disconnect ac power connections before disassembling the 732A.",
