   "html": "<p>Line drawing labeled \"REAR OF INSTRUMENT\": two side-by-side rectangular module openings, each with four corner screws; within each rectangle diagonal arrows cross in the middle at the label \"C\" (so both left and right modules are each marked \"C\" at their centers, arrows pointing outward to the four corner screws of that module).<\/p>\n<p>Caption below drawing: REMOVE SCREWS MARKED \"C\" TO REMOVE REAR MODULE(S).<\/p>",
   "text": "Line drawing labeled \"REAR OF INSTRUMENT\": two side-by-side rectangular module openings, each with four corner screws; within each rectangle diagonal arrows cross in the middle at the label \"C\" (so both left and right modules are each marked \"C\" at their centers, arrows pointing outward to the four corner screws of that module). Caption below drawing: REMOVE SCREWS MARKED \"C\" TO REMOVE REAR MODULE(S).",
