   "html": "<p>Four panels: <strong>ADJUSTABLE SOURCE<\/strong>, <strong>PRECISION DIVIDER<\/strong>, <strong>NULL DETECTOR<\/strong>, <strong>732A RU<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<ul><li><strong>ADJUSTABLE SOURCE<\/strong>: terminals <strong>HI<\/strong>, <strong>SENSE +<\/strong>, <strong>SENSE −<\/strong>, <strong>LO<\/strong>, <strong>GRD<\/strong>, <strong>GND<\/strong>. HI and SENSE+ both wired (leads through a tall loop) to Precision Divider <strong>1.0<\/strong> (the <strong>1.1<\/strong> terminal is drawn with no wire connected to it); SENSE− and LO both wired (through a second tall loop) to Precision Divider <strong>LO<\/strong>; GRD/GND jumpered, with GND wired to Null Detector <strong>GRD<\/strong>, to the bottom of the first tall loop (the second tall loop's bottom is wired to Precision Divider input <strong>GND<\/strong>), and to the twisted-pair loop on the Precision Divider output leads.<\/li><li><strong>PRECISION DIVIDER<\/strong>: input terminals <strong>1.1<\/strong>, <strong>1.0<\/strong> (circled \"A\" annotation below/beside the 1.0 terminal marking \"Point A\"), <strong>LO<\/strong>, <strong>GND<\/strong>, inside the labeled box; ratio shown as <strong>0.999999X<\/strong>. A second terminal cluster — <strong>HI<\/strong>, <strong>LO<\/strong>, <strong>GND<\/strong> — is drawn inside the box at its right side; its HI is wired (through a twisted-pair loop symbol) to Null Detector <strong>HI<\/strong>, its LO is wired along the bottom of the figure to the 732A RU top-row <strong>LO<\/strong> post, and its GND has no wire.<\/li><li><strong>NULL DETECTOR<\/strong>: terminals <strong>HI<\/strong>, <strong>LO<\/strong>, <strong>GRD<\/strong> (the HI and LO leads pass through a twisted-pair loop symbol).<\/li><li><strong>732A RU<\/strong>: binding posts, top row <strong>10V<\/strong>, <strong>LO<\/strong>; middle row <strong>1.018V<\/strong>, <strong>LO<\/strong>, <strong>1V<\/strong>; bottom row <strong>GND<\/strong>, <strong>GRD<\/strong>. RU 10V wired (through a twisted-pair loop symbol) to Null Detector LO; RU top-row LO wired to the Precision Divider output LO; RU GRD wired to the twisted-pair loop on the RU leads; RU GND has no wire.<\/li><\/ul>",
   "text": "Four panels: ADJUSTABLE SOURCE, PRECISION DIVIDER, NULL DETECTOR, 732A RU. ADJUSTABLE SOURCE: terminals HI, SENSE +, SENSE −, LO, GRD, GND. HI and SENSE+ both wired (leads through a tall loop) to Precision Divider 1.0 (the 1.1 terminal is drawn with no wire connected to it); SENSE− and LO both wired (through a second tall loop) to Precision Divider LO; GRD/GND jumpered, with GND wired to Null Detector GRD, to the bottom of the first tall loop (the second tall loop's bottom is wired to Precision Divider input GND), and to the twisted-pair loop on the Precision Divider output leads. PRECISION DIVIDER: input terminals 1.1, 1.0 (circled \"A\" annotation below/beside the 1.0 terminal marking \"Point A\"), LO, GND, inside the labeled box; ratio shown as 0.999999X. A second terminal cluster — HI, LO, GND — is drawn inside the box at its right side; its HI is wired (through a twisted-pair loop symbol) to Null Detector HI, its LO is wired along the bottom of the figure to the 732A RU top-row LO post, and its GND has no wire. NULL DETECTOR: terminals HI, LO, GRD (the HI and LO leads pass through a twisted-pair loop symbol). 732A RU: binding posts, top row 10V, LO; middle row 1.018V, LO, 1V; bottom row GND, GRD. RU 10V wired (through a twisted-pair loop symbol) to Null Detector LO; RU top-row LO wired to the Precision Divider output LO; RU GRD wired to the twisted-pair loop on the RU leads; RU GND has no wire.",
