   "level": 3,
   "boards": [],
   "html": "<p>Exploded view of the chassis/side-rail/oven assembly (drawing printed in landscape orientation, rotated 90° on the page). Callouts, transcribed as printed:<\/p>\n<ul><li>MP50 (REF) — leader to a heat-sink/finned extrusion at upper left.<\/li><li>H4(2), H19(2) — leaders to a screw/washer pair fastening into the extrusion.<\/li><li>A4 — leader to a component mounted through the extrusion (View A-A).<\/li><li>VIEW A-A — section-view label, with arrow \"A\" / \"A\" marking the cutting-plane arrows on the assembly below.<\/li><li>MP32(2) — leader to a mounting bracket in the View A-A detail.<\/li><li>A2 (REF) — leader to the motherboard, shown edge-on beneath the View A-A detail.<\/li><li>REAR PANEL — leader to the rear panel sub-assembly.<\/li><li>MP51(2), MP27(2) — leaders to a bracket/angle pair near the rear panel.<\/li><li>H12(16) — leader to screws securing the rear panel area.<\/li><li>MP40(2), MP9(2), MP21 — leaders to handle-support hardware near the top.<\/li><li>H11(2) — leader to a screw pair.<\/li><li>MP46(2), MP53(2), MP47(1) Left Side Only — leaders to side-trim pieces.<\/li><li>MP20 — leader to the long handle extrusion running diagonally across the assembly.<\/li><li>MP19(2), MP1 — leaders to a PCB card guide and the guard cover.<\/li><li>H2(REF), MP19(4), H1(16), MP26(4) — leaders to card-guide screws and chassis insulator, near the center of the assembly.<\/li><li>H2(12) — leader to another group of panel-mounting screws.<\/li><li>H10(8), H14(12) — leaders to screws on the side chassis rail at right.<\/li><li>MP11 — leader to the corner-plastic piece at far right.<\/li><li>MP34 — leader to the front panel (shown edge-on at lower right).<\/li><li>H2 (REF), MP48 — leaders near the bulkhead guard, lower left-center.<\/li><li>MP39(2) — leaders (two arrows) to banana plugs at lower left.<\/li><li>FROM A2 / To A4 — labels on a cable run at lower left, with \"A7 CABLE\" labelling the ribbon cable coming from the calibration board.<\/li><li>MP52(REF) — leader to a cable tie on the A7 cable.<\/li><li>To A5, MP44(4), A5 — leaders near the lower left corner identifying the cable to A5 and its spacers.<\/li><li>MP7 — leader to the oven strap.<\/li><li>MP42 — leader to the oven spacer.<\/li><li>MP6(3), MP5(3) — leaders to the oven inner/outer insulation pieces.<\/li><li>MP28 — leader to the front bulkhead guard.<\/li><li>MP30(2), MP25(4) — leaders to oven inner insulation (front-back) and hole plugs.<\/li><li>MP50 — leader (second instance) to the guard chassis at lower right, with wire-color tags \"GRN/YEL\" and \"BLU\" on a ring-tongue ground lug and a multi-conductor cable fanning out from a strain-relief clamp, labelled \"FROM A2\"; a twisted pair tagged \"GRA\", \"GRA\" runs to a second strain-relief clamp beside it.<\/li><li>MP26(REF) — leader to the chassis insulator (reference callout).<\/li><li>TAPE — leader to a taped cable bundle.<\/li><li>MP29(2) — leader to outer front-back oven insulation.<\/li><li>Sheet label at lower right: \"732A T&amp;B (2 of 4)\".<\/li><\/ul>\n<p>Caption: Figure 5-1. 732A Final Assembly (cont)<\/p>",
   "text": "Exploded view of the chassis/side-rail/oven assembly (drawing printed in landscape orientation, rotated 90° on the page). Callouts, transcribed as printed: MP50 (REF) — leader to a heat-sink/finned extrusion at upper left. H4(2), H19(2) — leaders to a screw/washer pair fastening into the extrusion. A4 — leader to a component mounted through the extrusion (View A-A). VIEW A-A — section-view label, with arrow \"A\" / \"A\" marking the cutting-plane arrows on the assembly below. MP32(2) — leader to a mounting bracket in the View A-A detail. A2 (REF) — leader to the motherboard, shown edge-on beneath the View A-A detail. REAR PANEL — leader to the rear panel sub-assembly. MP51(2), MP27(2) — leaders to a bracket/angle pair near the rear panel. H12(16) — leader to screws securing the rear panel area. MP40(2), MP9(2), MP21 — leaders to handle-support hardware near the top. H11(2) — leader to a screw pair. MP46(2), MP53(2), MP47(1) Left Side Only — leaders to side-trim pieces. MP20 — leader to the long handle extrusion running diagonally across the assembly. MP19(2), MP1 — leaders to a PCB card guide and the guard cover. H2(REF), MP19(4), H1(16), MP26(4) — leaders to card-guide screws and chassis insulator, near the center of the assembly. H2(12) — leader to another group of panel-mounting screws. H10(8), H14(12) — leaders to screws on the side chassis rail at right. MP11 — leader to the corner-plastic piece at far right. MP34 — leader to the front panel (shown edge-on at lower right). H2 (REF), MP48 — leaders near the bulkhead guard, lower left-center. MP39(2) — leaders (two arrows) to banana plugs at lower left. FROM A2 / To A4 — labels on a cable run at lower left, with \"A7 CABLE\" labelling the ribbon cable coming from the calibration board. MP52(REF) — leader to a cable tie on the A7 cable. To A5, MP44(4), A5 — leaders near the lower left corner identifying the cable to A5 and its spacers. MP7 — leader to the oven strap. MP42 — leader to the oven spacer. MP6(3), MP5(3) — leaders to the oven inner/outer insulation pieces. MP28 — leader to the front bulkhead guard. MP30(2), MP25(4) — leaders to oven inner insulation (front-back) and hole plugs. MP50 — leader (second instance) to the guard chassis at lower right, with wire-color tags \"GRN/YEL\" and \"BLU\" on a ring-tongue ground lug and a multi-conductor cable fanning out from a strain-relief clamp, labelled \"FROM A2\"; a twisted pair tagged \"GRA\", \"GRA\" runs to a second strain-relief clamp beside it. MP26(REF) — leader to the chassis insulator (reference callout). TAPE — leader to a taped cable bundle. MP29(2) — leader to outer front-back oven insulation. Sheet label at lower right: \"732A T&B (2 of 4)\". Caption: Figure 5-1. 732A Final Assembly (cont)",
