   "level": 2,
   "boards": [],
   "html": "<p>PDF page 76 is a blank page.<\/p>\n<p>PDF pages 77-80 contain Fluke corporate directory material that is not part of the numbered manual sections requested for transcription (Section 6, Section 7A, or Section 8 TOC): a \"U.S. SALES AREAS for all Fluke products\" listing (PDF p77), an \"INTERNATIONAL SALES OFFICES\" listing spanning two pages (PDF p78-79), and a \"TECHNICAL SERVICE CENTERS\" listing (PDF p80). Each is a multi-column directory of Fluke/John Fluke Mfg. Co. sales and service office addresses, phone numbers, and telex numbers by country/state, closed with the John Fluke Mfg. Co., Inc. / Fluke (Holland) B.V. boilerplate address block and \"Litho in U.S.A. 10/84\". These are not transcribed verbatim here as they fall outside the requested content (Section 6 accessories; Section 7 Manual Change Information / 7A / backdating / revision-level and assembly-part-number tables; Section 8 TOC and notes).<\/p>",
   "text": "PDF page 76 is a blank page. PDF pages 77-80 contain Fluke corporate directory material that is not part of the numbered manual sections requested for transcription (Section 6, Section 7A, or Section 8 TOC): a \"U.S. SALES AREAS for all Fluke products\" listing (PDF p77), an \"INTERNATIONAL SALES OFFICES\" listing spanning two pages (PDF p78-79), and a \"TECHNICAL SERVICE CENTERS\" listing (PDF p80). Each is a multi-column directory of Fluke/John Fluke Mfg. Co. sales and service office addresses, phone numbers, and telex numbers by country/state, closed with the John Fluke Mfg. Co., Inc. / Fluke (Holland) B.V. boilerplate address block and \"Litho in U.S.A. 10/84\". These are not transcribed verbatim here as they fall outside the requested content (Section 6 accessories; Section 7 Manual Change Information / 7A / backdating / revision-level and assembly-part-number tables; Section 8 TOC and notes).",
