   "file": "08-schematic-and-interconnect-notes.md",
   "group": "Section 8 · Schematic notes",
   "level": 3,
   "boards": [
    "A5"
   ],
   "html": "<p>Left edge (from A4 / mother board, wire colour lettered beside each):<\/p>\n<div class=\"manual-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>E<\/th><th>colour<\/th><th>lettering / net<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>E1<\/td><td>BRN<\/td><td>BUFFER AMP/DRIVER AMP COMMON<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E9<\/td><td>WHT<\/td><td>top of the U5 bridge (RT3/RT4 network)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E10<\/td><td>BLK<\/td><td>U5 output line<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E11<\/td><td>BRN<\/td><td>line lettered \"18.6V\" beside U5 (U5 supply)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E2<\/td><td>RED<\/td><td>bottom of the U5 bridge<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E8<\/td><td>GRA<\/td><td>\"18.6V\" — feeds CR5 / CR2 / SERIES PASS ELEMENT<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E3<\/td><td>ORN<\/td><td>common (bottom rail)<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<p>Right edge (to FRONT PANEL):<\/p>\n<div class=\"manual-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>E<\/th><th>lettering<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>E23<\/td><td>from SERIES PASS ELEMENT J2-6 output node<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E24<\/td><td>strapped to E23/E25 bus<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E25<\/td><td>strapped bus<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E33<\/td><td>10V HI<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E34<\/td><td>1.018V HI<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E35<\/td><td>1V HI<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E36<\/td><td>LO<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E26<\/td><td>strapped to E36/E27/E28 (LO bus)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E27<\/td><td>LO bus<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E28<\/td><td>LO bus<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E22<\/td><td>GRA → OVEN TEMP THMS (front panel) — RT2 across E22/E21<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>E21<\/td><td>GRA → OVEN TEMP THMS (front panel)<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<p>Lettered inside A5: \"BUFFER AMP/DRIVER AMP COMMON\"; \"18.6V\" (twice: on E8 and on the E11 line beside U5); \"U5\"; \"RT3 / RT4 } SENSES TEMP OF HR1–HR4 OVEN HEATERS\" (four unlabelled resistors form the bridge around RT3/RT4); \"CR5\"; \"CR2\"; \"(SEL)\" resistor; \"U2\" (transistor + zener in one outline); \"U1\" (op-amp, + and – inputs); \"R2\"; \"R3\"; a box lettered \"A4 Q12 / SERIES PASS ELEMENT / J2 6 / J2 7 8 9\" with harness numbers \"4\" (from J2-6) and \"5 6 7\" (from J2-7, 8, 9); a box lettered \"SERIES PASS DRIVE TRANSISTORS / A5 Q1, Q2\"; pots lettered \"1.018V ADJ\", \"1V ADJ\", \"10V ADJ\" with unlabelled fixed resistors in the divider; \"RT2\".<\/p>\n<p>A5 designators appearing on Fig 8-1: U5, RT3, RT4, CR5, CR2, U2, U1, R2, R3, Q1, Q2 (in the drive-transistor box), RT2, plus the \"(SEL)\" resistor and the three ADJ pots (no R numbers printed on this sheet).<\/p>",
   "text": "Left edge (from A4 / mother board, wire colour lettered beside each): E1 BRN BUFFER AMP/DRIVER AMP COMMON E9 WHT top of the U5 bridge (RT3/RT4 network) E10 BLK U5 output line E11 BRN line lettered \"18.6V\" beside U5 (U5 supply) E2 RED bottom of the U5 bridge E8 GRA \"18.6V\" — feeds CR5 / CR2 / SERIES PASS ELEMENT E3 ORN common (bottom rail) Right edge (to FRONT PANEL): E23 from SERIES PASS ELEMENT J2-6 output node E24 strapped to E23/E25 bus E25 strapped bus E33 10V HI E34 1.018V HI E35 1V HI E36 LO E26 strapped to E36/E27/E28 (LO bus) E27 LO bus E28 LO bus E22 GRA → OVEN TEMP THMS (front panel) — RT2 across E22/E21 E21 GRA → OVEN TEMP THMS (front panel) Lettered inside A5: \"BUFFER AMP/DRIVER AMP COMMON\"; \"18.6V\" (twice: on E8 and on the E11 line beside U5); \"U5\"; \"RT3 / RT4 } SENSES TEMP OF HR1–HR4 OVEN HEATERS\" (four unlabelled resistors form the bridge around RT3/RT4); \"CR5\"; \"CR2\"; \"(SEL)\" resistor; \"U2\" (transistor + zener in one outline); \"U1\" (op-amp, + and – inputs); \"R2\"; \"R3\"; a box lettered \"A4 Q12 / SERIES PASS ELEMENT / J2 6 / J2 7 8 9\" with harness numbers \"4\" (from J2-6) and \"5 6 7\" (from J2-7, 8, 9); a box lettered \"SERIES PASS DRIVE TRANSISTORS / A5 Q1, Q2\"; pots lettered \"1.018V ADJ\", \"1V ADJ\", \"10V ADJ\" with unlabelled fixed resistors in the divider; \"RT2\". A5 designators appearing on Fig 8-1: U5, RT3, RT4, CR5, CR2, U2, U1, R2, R3, Q1, Q2 (in the drive-transistor box), RT2, plus the \"(SEL)\" resistor and the three ADJ pots (no R numbers printed on this sheet).",
