   "html": "<ul><li>\"J1\" (3-pin, lettered N, G, L) — \"100-132V AC / 200-264V AC / 50-60 Hz / 30 VA\".<\/li><li>\"FL1\" (dashed box: two inductors lettered \"L\", three capacitors); \"CHASSIS\" ground symbols; \"GRN/YEL\" ground lead to chassis.<\/li><li>\"F1\" with \"100-132V 3/8A SB / 200-264V 3/16A SB\".<\/li><li>Wires from J1/FL1: \"BLK\" (line), \"WHT\" (neutral), \"GRN/YEL\" (ground).<\/li><li>T1 windings and lead colours: two primaries and two secondaries with dots; leads \"GRA\", \"WHT\", \"VIO\", \"BLU\", \"BRN\", \"YEL\", \"BLK\", \"ORN\", \"ORN\", \"GRN\" (GRN is the lead from the dashed shield beside the core, to E12 SHIELD #1; the core itself goes to E14 CORE); three dashed shield lines.<\/li><\/ul>",
   "text": "\"J1\" (3-pin, lettered N, G, L) — \"100-132V AC / 200-264V AC / 50-60 Hz / 30 VA\". \"FL1\" (dashed box: two inductors lettered \"L\", three capacitors); \"CHASSIS\" ground symbols; \"GRN/YEL\" ground lead to chassis. \"F1\" with \"100-132V 3/8A SB / 200-264V 3/16A SB\". Wires from J1/FL1: \"BLK\" (line), \"WHT\" (neutral), \"GRN/YEL\" (ground). T1 windings and lead colours: two primaries and two secondaries with dots; leads \"GRA\", \"WHT\", \"VIO\", \"BLU\", \"BRN\", \"YEL\", \"BLK\", \"ORN\", \"ORN\", \"GRN\" (GRN is the lead from the dashed shield beside the core, to E12 SHIELD #1; the core itself goes to E14 CORE); three dashed shield lines.",
