   "html": "<p>Rev.-C, A4 Regulator PCB Assembly (732A-4002)<\/p>\n<p>On page 5-16, Table 5-5:<\/p>\n<div class=\"manual-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Action<\/th><th>REF DES<\/th><th>Description<\/th><th>Fluke P/N<\/th><th>Mfr. Code<\/th><th>Mfr. P/N<\/th><th>Qty per Assy<\/th><th>...<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>CHANGE<\/td><td>CR1<\/td><td>DIODE, ZEN, UNCOMP<\/td><td>473744<\/td><td>07910<\/td><td>1N5240<\/td><td>2<\/td><td>1<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>TO<\/td><td>VR1,VR2<\/td><td>DIODE, ZEN UNCOMP<\/td><td>473744<\/td><td>07910<\/td><td>1N5240<\/td><td>3<\/td><td>1<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<p>CHANGE: CR9|...<br>TO: VR9|...<\/p>\n<p>On page 5-17, Figure 5-5, and page 8-8, Figure 8-4, change the REF DES's,<\/p>\n<p>FROM: CR1, CR2, CR9<br>TO: VR1, VR2, VR9<\/p>\n<p>Rev.-B, A5 Reference PCB Assembly (732A-4001)<\/p>\n<p>On page 5-21, Figure 5-6, change the REF DES's,<\/p>\n<p>FROM: CR1, CR2, CR9<br>TO: VR1, VR2, VR9<\/p>",
