   "group": "Errata · Issue 3, 7/85",
   "level": 2,
   "boards": [],
   "html": "<p>On page 5-22, Table 5-7,<\/p>\n<p>CHANGE: BT1-BT4| BATTERY, 6V GEL-CELL| 501379| 89536| 501379| 4<br>TO: BT1-BT4| BATTERY, 6V GEL-CELL| 739961| 89536| 739961| 4<\/p>\n<p>DELETE: J1-4|....<br>ADD: J10| CONNECTOR RECEPTACLE| 720854| 89536| 720854| 1<br>ADD: W1| WIRE ASSEMBLY, RED | 738377| 89536| 738377| 1<br>ADD: W2| WIRE ASSEMBLY, BLACK| 738385| 89536| 738385| 1<\/p>\n<p>On page 5-23, Figure 5-7, replace the entire figure with Figure 1.<\/p>\n<p>On page 8-4, Figure 8-2, replace the A6 Battery Module portion of the figure (732A-1604), with the top portion of Figure 1.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Figure 1.<\/strong> (illustration — A6 Battery Module Assembly, exploded/perspective view)<\/p>\n<ul><li>Top panel: eight battery lead wires with spade lugs (in four pairs) running down to terminals on the panel; callouts DS1, CR1, R1 (boxed), RT2, RT1 (with square symbols).<\/li><li>Main assembly, labeled A6, with parts callouts (several printed callouts also repeated in handwriting: MP1, A6, MP7 H5(6), H3, J10, MP6): MP1, MP3, A6, MP7 H5(6), H3, J10, MP10 H6(2) H7(2), H2(4), MP6, MP4, MP2, H4(12), H1 4, BT1, BT2, BT2 (sic — printed twice, likely BT2/BT3 rows), BT3; terminals E1, E2, E3 on the PCB.<\/li><li>Caption: Figure 1.<\/li><\/ul>",
   "text": "On page 5-22, Table 5-7, CHANGE: BT1-BT4| BATTERY, 6V GEL-CELL| 501379| 89536| 501379| 4 TO: BT1-BT4| BATTERY, 6V GEL-CELL| 739961| 89536| 739961| 4 DELETE: J1-4|.... ADD: J10| CONNECTOR RECEPTACLE| 720854| 89536| 720854| 1 ADD: W1| WIRE ASSEMBLY, RED | 738377| 89536| 738377| 1 ADD: W2| WIRE ASSEMBLY, BLACK| 738385| 89536| 738385| 1 On page 5-23, Figure 5-7, replace the entire figure with Figure 1. On page 8-4, Figure 8-2, replace the A6 Battery Module portion of the figure (732A-1604), with the top portion of Figure 1. Figure 1. (illustration — A6 Battery Module Assembly, exploded/perspective view) Top panel: eight battery lead wires with spade lugs (in four pairs) running down to terminals on the panel; callouts DS1, CR1, R1 (boxed), RT2, RT1 (with square symbols). Main assembly, labeled A6, with parts callouts (several printed callouts also repeated in handwriting: MP1, A6, MP7 H5(6), H3, J10, MP6): MP1, MP3, A6, MP7 H5(6), H3, J10, MP10 H6(2) H7(2), H2(4), MP6, MP4, MP2, H4(12), H1 4, BT1, BT2, BT2 (sic — printed twice, likely BT2/BT3 rows), BT3; terminals E1, E2, E3 on the PCB. Caption: Figure 1.",
