   "html": "<p>On page 2-4, Table 2-2,<\/p>\n<p>Replace the FEATURE NAME and the DESCRIPTION for ITEM NO.6 with,<\/p>\n<div class=\"manual-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>FEATURE NAME<\/th><th>DESCRIPTION<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>EXTERNAL POWER INPUT connector<\/td><td>External power input connector for connecting an external power source (24-40V dc or 24-30V ac, 50-440 Hz). The internal back-up battery voltage may also be measured at this connector.<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>",
   "text": "On page 2-4, Table 2-2, Replace the FEATURE NAME and the DESCRIPTION for ITEM NO.6 with, EXTERNAL POWER INPUT connector External power input connector for connecting an external power source (24-40V dc or 24-30V ac, 50-440 Hz). The internal back-up battery voltage may also be measured at this connector.",
   "mentions": []
