   "html": "<p><strong>Figure 7.<\/strong> (schematic excerpt)<br>Right edge labeled \"P2 J2\". Block \"OVEN HEATER\" with leads BLK (4 WIRES) from node E1, HR1-HR4, WHT (4 WIRES) to node E2, feeding into Q14/Q13 (R24 from E1 node to Q14 base, R25 from Q14/Q13 junction, R26 in series with Q13 output) to output pins 26, 27, 2 (labeled on right edge, at connector \"P2 J2\"; pin 1 at the top of the same edge feeds the Q14 node). Block \"OVEN HEATER DRIVER\" beneath the transistor pair. Left side: fuse F2 with leads \"20 YEL\" and \"19 YEL\" going \"To Front Panel\". Connector \"J2 P2\" with pins 12, 11, 13, 14, 15 going \"To Front Panel\". Along the 18.6V/TP1 rail: diode CR2, transistors Q2 and Q1 (Q2 base tied to CR2 node, Q1 collector through R22), R7 (below Q1), transistor Q8 with diode CR14 near it. Node \"TP1\" and \"18.6V\" label near top; R5 resistor to Q5 transistor to pin 10. R4 resistor. \"LATCH CKT Q6 Q7\" block feeding pins 16 and 18, pin 18 to \"IN CAL\" LED lamp (front panel).<br>Caption: Figure 7.<\/p>",
   "text": "Figure 7. (schematic excerpt) Right edge labeled \"P2 J2\". Block \"OVEN HEATER\" with leads BLK (4 WIRES) from node E1, HR1-HR4, WHT (4 WIRES) to node E2, feeding into Q14/Q13 (R24 from E1 node to Q14 base, R25 from Q14/Q13 junction, R26 in series with Q13 output) to output pins 26, 27, 2 (labeled on right edge, at connector \"P2 J2\"; pin 1 at the top of the same edge feeds the Q14 node). Block \"OVEN HEATER DRIVER\" beneath the transistor pair. Left side: fuse F2 with leads \"20 YEL\" and \"19 YEL\" going \"To Front Panel\". Connector \"J2 P2\" with pins 12, 11, 13, 14, 15 going \"To Front Panel\". Along the 18.6V/TP1 rail: diode CR2, transistors Q2 and Q1 (Q2 base tied to CR2 node, Q1 collector through R22), R7 (below Q1), transistor Q8 with diode CR14 near it. Node \"TP1\" and \"18.6V\" label near top; R5 resistor to Q5 transistor to pin 10. R4 resistor. \"LATCH CKT Q6 Q7\" block feeding pins 16 and 18, pin 18 to \"IN CAL\" LED lamp (front panel). Caption: Figure 7.",
