   "html": "<p>On page 4-14, following paragraph 4-45, step 26, add:<\/p>\n<p><strong>4-45A. BATTERY CHARGING NOTES<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>4-45b. Battery Charge<\/strong><br>4-45c. To check the charging and discharging current on the Battery Pack, connect a milliammeter to the two black wires on the Battery ON/OFF switch. Then set the ON/OFF switch to OFF.<\/p>\n<p><em>(continued on next page)<\/em><\/p>",
   "text": "On page 4-14, following paragraph 4-45, step 26, add: 4-45A. BATTERY CHARGING NOTES 4-45b. Battery Charge 4-45c. To check the charging and discharging current on the Battery Pack, connect a milliammeter to the two black wires on the Battery ON/OFF switch. Then set the ON/OFF switch to OFF. (continued on next page)",
