   "html": "<ol start=\"5\"><li>Based on the measured variable resistance, select the appropriate trim resistor from Table 4-4.<\/li><\/ol>\n<p><strong>NOTE<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>When adjusting the 1.0V tap, select two resistors from Table 4-4 and add them to get the required resistance. For the 1.08V tap (as printed; probable typo for \"1.018V tap\"), measure each installed trim resistor and select only one to give the required resistance.<\/p>",
   "text": "Based on the measured variable resistance, select the appropriate trim resistor from Table 4-4. NOTE When adjusting the 1.0V tap, select two resistors from Table 4-4 and add them to get the required resistance. For the 1.08V tap (as printed; probable typo for \"1.018V tap\"), measure each installed trim resistor and select only one to give the required resistance.",
