   "html": "<p><strong>Figure 9.<\/strong> (PCB layout drawing — A5 Reference PCB with A8 piggyback PCB)<br>Left column top to bottom: VR6, Q2, Q1, C15, R24, R26 (top row); R64 (hand-lettered, under Q1), CR7, VR1, U1; R25, C4, R60, C14, Q5, R5; R62, R6, TP1, TP2; VR8, C2, VR2, CR5; R63, R9; C10; R36, R35, C9; R37, R33 (hand-lettered, resemble \"237\", \"233\"); C13, R32 (hand-lettered \"232\", under C13); R34, C8. Right of C13: vertical resistors R30 and R31 (labels hand-lettered, \"R 31\" split), and R40 (\"R 40\" split, vertical) next to U4.<br>Center columns: R3, R2, R4, R7, R8 (row of resistor boxes); R17, R16, R15, R14, R13 (row); R12, TP4, TP3; R10, R11, R19; U2, C16, R1, C17; C3, RT2, RT1; C1, R61, R43, U5, R38 (top of pair), R39 (below it), U4, C12, R41 (boxed), C11, R42, R23; U3, CR3 (hand-lettered, reads \"C23\"), C24 (label split \"C2\"/\"4\"), R21 (\"R 21\" split), R27, R28, R29, Q3, Q4 (\"Q 4\" split), C5, C6, C7, R22, TP5, TP6, TP7, TP8, TP9, TP10.<br>Right block labeled A8 (piggyback PCB, solid outline) with: R18 (above), TP14, R48 (dashed outline), R20; TP13, R52, R53; R56, R54; R58; R57, R55; TP11, TP12, R49 (dashed outline); below A8: R50, R51 (vertical), R59 (large box with shaft/knob symbol).<br>Caption: Figure 9.<\/p>",
