   "html": "<p>On page 8-11, change Figure 8-5, as shown in Figure 10, to show the addition of the A8 PCB to the A5 PCB.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Figure 10.<\/strong> (schematic — A8 piggyback divider network, 732A-1008)<br>Top rail labeled E33 (10V HI). Ladder network, top row: R57 350, R55 35, R54 35, R58 200 (with wiper); second row: R59 200 (with wiper), test-point flags TP12 and TP13, R56 1K; third row: R50 SEL, R53 SEL; bottom row: R51 SEL, test-point flag TP11, R49 35, R48 35, test-point flag TP14, R52 SEL.<br>Dashed box labeled \"A8 / 732A-1008 / PIGGYBACK PCB\" containing connector pins J1-J5 and: R47 8.7K (from J3, top left) down to J5, J5 → node E34 (1.018V HI); R45 1K from J5 down to J2 (bottom left); R46 8.9K (from J1, top right) down to J4, J4 → node E35 (1V HI); R44 1K from J4 down to the bottom node.<br>Below the dashed box: node E36 (LO); R63 2.7 1/2W,5% → node E23 (10V HI).<br>Caption: Figure 10.<\/p>",
   "text": "On page 8-11, change Figure 8-5, as shown in Figure 10, to show the addition of the A8 PCB to the A5 PCB. Figure 10. (schematic — A8 piggyback divider network, 732A-1008) Top rail labeled E33 (10V HI). Ladder network, top row: R57 350, R55 35, R54 35, R58 200 (with wiper); second row: R59 200 (with wiper), test-point flags TP12 and TP13, R56 1K; third row: R50 SEL, R53 SEL; bottom row: R51 SEL, test-point flag TP11, R49 35, R48 35, test-point flag TP14, R52 SEL. Dashed box labeled \"A8 / 732A-1008 / PIGGYBACK PCB\" containing connector pins J1-J5 and: R47 8.7K (from J3, top left) down to J5, J5 → node E34 (1.018V HI); R45 1K from J5 down to J2 (bottom left); R46 8.9K (from J1, top right) down to J4, J4 → node E35 (1V HI); R44 1K from J4 down to the bottom node. Below the dashed box: node E36 (LO); R63 2.7 1/2W,5% → node E23 (10V HI). Caption: Figure 10.",
