   "level": 2,
   "boards": [],
   "html": "<p>On pages 5-14 and 8-6, Figures 5-4 and 8-3, add R19 as shown in Figure 11.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Figure 11.<\/strong> (PCB layout drawing — A3 Pre-Regulator PCB)<br>Top area: R3 box; C3 (large box); CR1 (box), CR19, TP3, CR3, CR2, TP4 (right side); Q3 (in heat-sink bracket, left), CR15, R7, R10, C4; CR18, CR28, R4, DS1 (round), C1 (large box, right); CR11, R8, R6; R14, C5, R15, Q4, CR23, R13, CR22, C6, RT1, R17, TP1, R16, R18, R12, R19, R20, CR14; CR21, TP5, CR20, R11, W1, Q5, TP2, CR26, Q6, CR16, CR13; CR25, CR24, C2 (oval); R9, CR4, CR6, CR5, CR7, CR10, CR8, CR12, CR9; R1 (vertical, right edge), TP6. Lower-right corner label \"P3\" and connector notch shapes at bottom.<br>Caption: Figure 11.<\/p>\n<p>On page 8-7, Figure 8-3, change the value for R8 from 402K to 402, and add R19 as shown in Figure 12.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Figure 12.<\/strong> (schematic — A3 Pre-Regulator, current source / battery charger section)<br>Left: Q2, CR18, CR20 1MA, CR26 3MA, CR14 5.2V, TP2, W1; R6 510; Q3, C4 4700pf; CR11; R7 22.6 1/8W,1%; R8 402 1/8W,1%; Q4; R10 500 (with wiper, \"CW\" arrow); CR15 5.6V; C5 1 (+); CR23.<br>Center: R11 6.65K 1/8W,1%; CR22 1MA; Q5; CR21 1MA; R12 16.2K 1/8W,1%; R15 10K; R13 33.2K 1/8W,1%; R14 17.4K 1/8W,1%.<br>Right column: CR13; Q6; CR16; TP5; R16 10K; CR28 .47MA; R19 15K; RT1 10K; R17 6.49K; C6 .01; R18 43.2K; R20 50K (with wiper); TP1.<br>Output pin list at right: 11 = THERMISTOR; 9 = + BATTERY; 10 (bracketed with 9); 13/14 = + BATTERY CHARGE LED / - ; 12 = THERMISTOR; 15/16 = THERMISTOR VOLTAGE COMPENSATION; 17/18 = - BATTERY.<br>Caption: Figure 12.<\/p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>(End of Change/Errata Information, Issue No. 3, 7/85 — 18 pages total)<\/em><\/p>",
   "text": "On pages 5-14 and 8-6, Figures 5-4 and 8-3, add R19 as shown in Figure 11. Figure 11. (PCB layout drawing — A3 Pre-Regulator PCB) Top area: R3 box; C3 (large box); CR1 (box), CR19, TP3, CR3, CR2, TP4 (right side); Q3 (in heat-sink bracket, left), CR15, R7, R10, C4; CR18, CR28, R4, DS1 (round), C1 (large box, right); CR11, R8, R6; R14, C5, R15, Q4, CR23, R13, CR22, C6, RT1, R17, TP1, R16, R18, R12, R19, R20, CR14; CR21, TP5, CR20, R11, W1, Q5, TP2, CR26, Q6, CR16, CR13; CR25, CR24, C2 (oval); R9, CR4, CR6, CR5, CR7, CR10, CR8, CR12, CR9; R1 (vertical, right edge), TP6. Lower-right corner label \"P3\" and connector notch shapes at bottom. Caption: Figure 11. On page 8-7, Figure 8-3, change the value for R8 from 402K to 402, and add R19 as shown in Figure 12. Figure 12. (schematic — A3 Pre-Regulator, current source / battery charger section) Left: Q2, CR18, CR20 1MA, CR26 3MA, CR14 5.2V, TP2, W1; R6 510; Q3, C4 4700pf; CR11; R7 22.6 1/8W,1%; R8 402 1/8W,1%; Q4; R10 500 (with wiper, \"CW\" arrow); CR15 5.6V; C5 1 (+); CR23. Center: R11 6.65K 1/8W,1%; CR22 1MA; Q5; CR21 1MA; R12 16.2K 1/8W,1%; R15 10K; R13 33.2K 1/8W,1%; R14 17.4K 1/8W,1%. Right column: CR13; Q6; CR16; TP5; R16 10K; CR28 .47MA; R19 15K; RT1 10K; R17 6.49K; C6 .01; R18 43.2K; R20 50K (with wiper); TP1. Output pin list at right: 11 = THERMISTOR; 9 = + BATTERY; 10 (bracketed with 9); 13/14 = + BATTERY CHARGE LED / - ; 12 = THERMISTOR; 15/16 = THERMISTOR VOLTAGE COMPENSATION; 17/18 = - BATTERY. Caption: Figure 12. (End of Change/Errata Information, Issue No. 3, 7/85 — 18 pages total)",
